        "id": "p19-q13-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{7}-\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{7}+\\sqrt{2}}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{9-2\\sqrt{14}}{5}$",
          "worked": "Multiply numerator and denominator by the conjugate $\\sqrt{7}-\\sqrt{2}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\frac{\\sqrt{7}-\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{7}+\\sqrt{2}}&=\\frac{(\\sqrt{7}-\\sqrt{2})^2}{(\\sqrt{7}+\\sqrt{2})(\\sqrt{7}-\\sqrt{2})}\\\\\n\\frac{\\sqrt{7}-\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{7}+\\sqrt{2}}&=\\frac{7-2\\sqrt{14}+2}{7-2}\\\\\n\\frac{\\sqrt{7}-\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{7}+\\sqrt{2}}&=\\frac{9-2\\sqrt{14}}{5}\n\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p19-q13-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{3\\sqrt{3}+5}{3\\sqrt{3}-5}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$26+15\\sqrt{3}$",
          "worked": "Multiply numerator and denominator by the conjugate $3\\sqrt{3}+5$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}+5}{3\\sqrt{3}-5}&=\\frac{(3\\sqrt{3}+5)^2}{(3\\sqrt{3}-5)(3\\sqrt{3}+5)}\\\\\n\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}+5}{3\\sqrt{3}-5}&=\\frac{27+30\\sqrt{3}+25}{27-25}\\\\\n\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}+5}{3\\sqrt{3}-5}&=26+15\\sqrt{3}\n\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      }
    ]
